# BUGS

On the Mali driver a pass clears its target (it can't keep what was there), takes no scissor but the whole target, no indexed or indirect draw and no first vertex or instance; a pass of more than sixteen draws is refused (gpucore(2) says what the Mali backend refuses).

`present` copies the frame through the CPU into the window's surface: the window doesn't yet take the GPU's own buffer.
